A5 · AC-5 · accept the full name "Al" (2 letters, the lower limit)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Al","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 201, full_name "Al"

A6 · AC-5 · accept a full name of 100 letters (the upper limit)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"<100 letters>","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 201, full_name is the 100 letters

A7 · AC-5 · accept the full name "Ñoño O'Brien-Cruz Jr." (Ñ and . - ')
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ñoño O'Brien-Cruz Jr.","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 201, full_name "Ñoño O'Brien-Cruz Jr."

A12 · AC-5 · refuse the full name "A" (1 letter)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"A","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"full_name":"2-100 characters: letters, spaces, . - ' and Ñ only"}}

A13 · AC-5 · refuse the full name "  A  " (1 letter with spaces around)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"  A  ","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"full_name":"2-100 characters: letters, spaces, . - ' and Ñ only"}}

A14 · AC-5 · refuse a full name of 101 letters (one too many)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"<101 letters>","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"full_name":"2-100 characters: letters, spaces, . - ' and Ñ only"}}

A15 · AC-5 · refuse the full name "Ana 2" (a digit)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana 2","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"full_name":"2-100 characters: letters, spaces, . - ' and Ñ only"}}

A16 · AC-5 · refuse the full name "Ana@Cruz" (a symbol)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana@Cruz","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"full_name":"2-100 characters: letters, spaces, . - ' and Ñ only"}}

A17 · AC-5 · refuse a blank full name ""
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"full_name":"2-100 characters: letters, spaces, . - ' and Ñ only"}}

A11 · AC-8 · accept the mobile +639 + 9 digits (saved as 09 + the same 9 digits)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"+639<9 new digits>"}
→ 201, mobile saved as 09 + the same 9 digits

A18 · AC-8 · refuse the mobile 0917123456 (10 digits)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"0917123456"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"mobile":"must be a PH mobile 09XXXXXXXXX or +639XXXXXXXXX"}}

A19 · AC-8 · refuse the mobile 091712345678 (12 digits)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"091712345678"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"mobile":"must be a PH mobile 09XXXXXXXXX or +639XXXXXXXXX"}}

A20 · AC-8 · refuse the mobile "0917 123 4567" (spaces)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"0917 123 4567"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"mobile":"must be a PH mobile 09XXXXXXXXX or +639XXXXXXXXX"}}

A21 · AC-8 · refuse the mobile 0917-123-4567 (dashes)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"0917-123-4567"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"mobile":"must be a PH mobile 09XXXXXXXXX or +639XXXXXXXXX"}}

A22 · AC-8 · refuse the mobile 08171234567 (starts with 08)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"08171234567"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"mobile":"must be a PH mobile 09XXXXXXXXX or +639XXXXXXXXX"}}

A23 · AC-8 · refuse the mobile +638171234567 (starts with +638)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"+638171234567"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"mobile":"must be a PH mobile 09XXXXXXXXX or +639XXXXXXXXX"}}

A8 · AC-6 · accept a blank email "" (saved as null)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"<new mobile>","email":""}
→ 201, email null

A9 · AC-6 · accept the email "rosa@example.com"
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"<new mobile>","email":"rosa@example.com"}
→ 201, email "rosa@example.com"

A10 · AC-6 · accept an email of 254 characters (the limit)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"<new mobile>","email":"<242 a>@example.com"}
→ 201, email is the 254 characters

A24 · AC-6 · refuse the email "rosa.example.com" (no @)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {…,"email":"rosa.example.com"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"email":"invalid email format"}}

A25 · AC-6 · refuse the email "rosa@@example.com" (two @)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {…,"email":"rosa@@example.com"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"email":"invalid email format"}}

A26 · AC-6 · refuse the email "rosa@examplecom" (no dot after @)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {…,"email":"rosa@examplecom"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"email":"invalid email format"}}

A27 · AC-6 · refuse an email of 255 characters (one too many)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {…,"email":"<243 a>@example.com"}
→ 422 {"detail":{"email":"invalid email format"}}

A1 · AC-1 · create a taxpayer using "Ana Dela Cruz" and a new mobile, no email
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 201, full_name "Ana Dela Cruz", mobile <new mobile>, email null, has taxpayer_id and created_at

A4 · AC-3 · create a taxpayer using "  Ana Dela Cruz  " (spaces around): saved as "Ana Dela Cruz"
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"  Ana Dela Cruz  ","mobile":"<new mobile>"}
→ 201, full_name "Ana Dela Cruz"

A28 · AC-4 · refuse a mobile I already registered (409)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ben Dela Cruz","mobile":"<a mobile I already registered>"}
→ 409 {"detail":{"mobile":"already registered for this tenant"}}

A29 · AC-4 · refuse a mobile I already registered, sent in +639 form (409)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ben Dela Cruz","mobile":"+639<the same 9 digits>"}
→ 409 {"detail":{"mobile":"already registered for this tenant"}}

A30 · AC-5 · save nothing when the full name "A" is refused (the same mobile then works)
POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"A","mobile":"<new mobile>"} then POST /api/v1/training/taxpayers {"full_name":"Ana Dela Cruz","mobile":"<the same mobile>"}
→ first 422, then 201 (the refused one was not saved)

A2 · AC-2 · read back the taxpayer from A1 by its taxpayer_id
GET /api/v1/training/taxpayers/{taxpayer_id}
→ 200, the same taxpayer_id, full_name, mobile, email, created_at as A1

A31 · AC-7 · hide my taxpayer from another user (X-User-ID <me>-probe gets 404)
GET /api/v1/training/taxpayers/{taxpayer_id} with X-User-ID: <me>-probe
→ 404 {"detail":"Not Found"}

A33 · AC-7 · treat my name-tag in other letter case as another user (404)
GET /api/v1/training/taxpayers/{taxpayer_id} with X-User-ID: <my name-tag in other case, e.g. ana-4821>
→ 404 {"detail":"Not Found"}

A34 · AC-7 · refuse a request with no X-User-ID header (422)
GET /api/v1/training/taxpayers/{taxpayer_id} with no X-User-ID
→ 422 {"detail":{"X-User-ID":"required header"}}
